      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is probably not what you want to do. In the general case, there will already be an active value of `cur_ams_ctrl_req`, e.g. `PD_CTRL_VCONN_SWAP`, and changing that value would affect the subsequent handling. If you\u0027re trying to add special handling for the Request/Accept/PS_RDY sequence initiated by the emulator, that may take some refactoring or at least a quick hack. See my comment elsewhere.",
